        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Cabeçada. Cranidos vivia nas selvas há cem milhões de anos e enfrentava Aerodactyl com cabeçadas. Esses Pokémon também batiam as cabeças entre si para torná-las ainda mais resistentes.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Cranidos pode evoluir para Rampardos no nível 10 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Headbutt, Leer</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Focus Energy</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Pursuit, Rock Smash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Scary Face</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Assurance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Chip Away, Slam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Ancient Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Zen Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Head Smash</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Blizzard, Body Slam, Bulldoze, Confide, Crunch, Curse, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Dragon Cheer, Dragon Pulse, Earth Power, Earthquake, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Fire Blast, Fire Punch, Flamethrower, Fling, Focus Energy, Frustration, Hidden Power, Ice Beam, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Mud-Slap, Payback, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Roar, Rock Blast, Rock Polish, Rock Slide, Rock Smash, Rock Tomb, Round, Sandstorm, Scary Face, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Smack Down, Snore, Spite, Stealth Rock, Stomping Tantrum, Stone Edge, Substitute, Sunny Day, Superpower, Swagger, Swords Dance, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Punch, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Trailblaze, Uproar, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Crunch, Curse, Double-Edge, Hammer Arm, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Leer, Slam, Stomp, Thrash, Whirlwind</p>",
